Package: comined
Type: Package
Title: Constrained Minimum Energy Design
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-07-28
Author: Wenje Ma
Maintainer: Wenje Ma <wenjema@example.com>
Description: Implements the Constrained Minimum Energy Design (COMiNED)
    algorithm from Huang et al. (2021) for generating candidate points
    within a constrained region. Uses a sequence of increasing penalty
    parameters tau to progressively tighten constraints via probit
    relaxation, combined with minimum energy design for efficient
    space-filling sampling. Designed for experimental design problems
    where the feasible region is a subset of [0,1]^p defined by
    inequality constraints.
